#
#    AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.*
#        M1 controls, redesigned (move1_controls, SightEncounter): a real object (the seek stage's pool) at a hallway
#        point of the Stockades Nearest to Furthest yards (straight) from a random hallway spawn, in sight of the seat's
#        eye; from CornerFrom on the fade's ladder (1 - the shaping scale), CornerShare of the episodes put it just
#        round a corner instead (out of sight of the spawn, in sight of a hallway point within CornerStep yards of it).
#        Attempts candidates are tested at most. Arriving is stopping within the object's bounding radius plus
#        ArriveTolerance yards of its centre. The compass is withheld for an episode with Withhold0..3 at the fade's
#        rungs x1, x0.5, x0.25 and x0 (linear between): its presence and values read 0, an absent input, never a mask.
#        The defaults 0.25, 0.6, 0.9, 0.9 (shaping x1, x0.5, x0.25, x0) put a quarter of the episodes without the
#        compass from the first rung, each paid the dense shaping at the rung's scale (the camera learns from a reward
#        that points at the object), and fade only the shaping on the last step; the withholding is not tied to the
#        shaping reaching 0.
#        Stuck and Wall (per second; Wall at no movement, scaled by WallSlide as MarkerGround's) are charged at this
#        fixed price from the first step, off the cost ladder: small beside Arrive 3, set from M1's first evaluation.
#        Arrive, StepCost, Death, Progress, Facing and the stop's settings are Markers.*.
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Nearest = 10.0
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Furthest = 120.0
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.ArriveTolerance = 1.0
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.CornerShare = 0.25
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.CornerFrom = 0.75
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.CornerStep = 8.0
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Attempts = 64
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Withhold0 = 0.25
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Withhold1 = 0.6
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Withhold2 = 0.9
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Withhold3 = 0.9
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Stuck = 0.02
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.Wall = 0.02
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Controls.WallSlide = 0.5

#
#    AnimusForge.Curriculum.Combat.*
#        The combat stages (combat1_fight, combat2_packs, combat3_survive; CombatEncounter, dungeon-curriculum C1-C3):
#        creatures on a cleared Ragefire Chasm, fought by a seat that sees them. Outcome (times the tier's
#        w = 1 + Difficulty.TierScale x tier): Kill a C1 creature, Clear a C2/C3 pack, Survived the episode with no
#        death (SurviveSurvived in C3); InterruptLanded an interrupt that stopped a cast, unscaled. Cost, fixed price
#        from the first step: Away per second dead or away from the fight (walking back from the entrance, or beyond
#        AwayYards of the pull while it fights), Death and AllyDeath (divided by w), Hurt and FireHurt per maximum
#        health taken (all of it, and from ground effects), ExtraPull a second pack drawn in, Clock per second a
#        creature of the pull is alive and engaged. Shaping (faded): Damage per creature health dealt. The ladder (per
#        class and build, on its window alone): the seat's level + LevelBase + rung x LevelsPerTier (C2 half the steps,
#        its packs growing), elites from EliteTier, a caster from CasterTier, linked packs from LinkedTier,
#        HazardChance percent of C2 packs with fire; C3's packs SurviveSize strong, SurviveLevels higher. The seat
#        starts on one of the dungeon's own creature spawns within CorridorWalk yards' walk of the entrance
#        (CorridorSpacing apart); a pull stands FightNearest-FightFurthest yards off (past a same-level creature's
#        ~20 yd aggro) in its sight, the next pack NextNearest-NextFurthest further on; C1's next creature NextFightMs
#        after a kill. A death: Respawn.DelayMs out, then alive at the entrance (dungeon-curriculum I4).
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Combat.Kill = 1.0
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Combat.Clear = 2.0
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Combat.Survived = 1.0
