#
#    AnimusForge.Curriculum.Roles.*
#        The roles stage (group1_roles; RolesEncounter, dungeon-curriculum G1): a party of five on the combat stages'
#        cleared Ragefire Chasm, one role drilled an episode in seat 0 (tank_hold, heal_keep, damage_discipline, pull),
#        the others a proper party around it (learned, a partner, or the "human" stand-in in StandInShare percent of
#        the training episodes, never in the drilled seat). Outcome (times w = 1 + Difficulty.TierScale x rung): Clear
#        per pack (every seat); the drilled seat's lesson, its own -- Hold per enemy on the tank a decision, Keep per
#        member above half health a decision, Focus per damage-scale share on the tank's target, PullClean per pack
#        cleared alone (the others PullOthers of it); Survived with no death of the seat's own. Cost (losses divided
#        by w): Loose per enemy on someone else, PulledOff per enemy the damage dealer took off the tank, KeepLow per
#        member under 35% or dead, Overheal of healing wasted (x Party.TeammateHealing), PullExtra per second pack in a
#        fight (the puller in full, the others PullOthers), Death, Away per second dead or beyond AwayYards of a
#        fight, Clock per second a pack fights. Shaping (faded): Damage per creature health dealt. The ladder (per class
#        and build of the drilled seat, on its own window): the party's level + LevelBase + rung x LevelsPerTier / 2;
#        packs of PackSizeFirst, one more every PackGrowEvery rungs up to PackSizeMax; a caster from CasterTier, linked
#        from LinkedTier, an elite from EliteTier; heal_keep's packs at KeepHealthPct of their health; the pull drill's
#        camp of CampPacksFirst packs (one more every two rungs, up to CampPacksMax), CampSpacingFirst yards apart at
#        rung 0 closing to CampSpacingLast at the top. The party stands PartyNearest-PartyFurthest yards round seat 0.
#        Won: a pack cleared, no wipe, and the drill's measure (WinHold of the enemy-decisions on the tank; nobody
#        dead; WinFocus of the damage dealer's damage on the tank's target, at most WinPulledSeconds of enemies taken
#        off it; no second pack in a fight).
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Roles.Clear = 1.0
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Roles.Hold = 0.045
AnimusForge.Curriculum.Roles.Loose = 0.018
